 "answer": "CD-12013: Hi there,\n\nThank you for reaching out. Based on our system records, your account was locked due to repeated failed login attempts. The temporary lock period is 15 minutes.\n\nTo recover your account:\n\n1. **Stop attempting to log in** immediately.\n2. **Wait 15 minutes** before trying again.\n3. Ensure you are using the correct email address.\n4. Verify that you are using the latest password.\n5. Try logging in again.\n\nPlease follow these steps carefully. Once you've waited 15 minutes, try logging in once more. If you still encounter issues, please contact Customer Support for further assistance.\n\nBest regards,\nCloudDesk Support Team",
